<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color:#f5f5f5;">
<table align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px; margin:40px auto; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
    <tr>
        <td style="padding:40px; text-align:center;">
            <h1 style="font-size:24px; color:#333; margin-bottom:20px;">Welcome, {{firstName}} {{lastName}}!</h1>
            <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:25px;">
                Thank you for registering at <strong>Amazon Clone</strong>! Amazon Clone is a modern, full-stack e-commerce platform powered by a NestJS microservices (TCP) backend and a ReactJS (Vite) frontend.
            </p>

            <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:30px;">
                Please verify your email to activate your account and start shopping.
            </p>

            <a href="{{url}}"
               style="display:inline-block; padding:14px 25px; background-color:#007bff; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; border-radius:6px;">
                Verify My Email
            </a>

            <p style="font-size:14px; color:#999; margin-top:25px; line-height:1.4;">
                This link will expire in 72 hours.
            </p>

            <p style="font-size:14px; color:#999; margin-top:10px; line-height:1.4;">
                If you did not request this email, you can safely ignore it.
            </p>

            <hr style="margin:30px 0; border:none; border-top:1px solid #eee;">

            <p style="font-size:14px; color:#666; line-height:1.4; margin-top:0;">
                If you have any suggestions or would like to contribute, feel free to contact us at
                <a href="mailto:tranqanh2810@gmail.com" style="color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;">tranqanh2810@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>

            <p style="font-size:12px; color:#aaa; margin-top:15px;">&copy; 2025 Amazon Clone. All rights reserved.</p>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
